OL,3,GNEWSA'Apples are my passion' - cider
OL,4,Amaker gets award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA craft cider maker who has spent 25
OL,7,Fyears in the industry and set up his
OL,8,Fown successful business has been given
OL,9,Fan award in recognition of his service
OL,10,Fto the sector.
OL,12,FBarny Butterfield was working as a farm
OL,13,Flabourer before he had an idea that
OL,14,Fwould eventually see him set up
OL,15,FSandford Orchards near Crediton in
OL,16,FDevon, which now spans 150 acres (60.7
OL,17,FHectares) and produces seven million
OL,18,Fbottles of cider a year.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
