OL,3,GNEWSA'Apples are my passion' - cider
OL,4,Amaker gets award
OL,5,
OL,6,FButterfield has been given a lifetime
OL,7,Fachievement award by the Royal Bath and
OL,8,FWest Society for his efforts to keep
OL,9,Fcider making vibrant.
OL,11,F"I didn't invent cider making but
OL,12,Fpeople wanted it back where it belonged
OL,13,Fin Devon," he said.
